OL,3,GNEWSA'Our queer feature film puts
OL,4,Aregion on the map'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent feature film created by
OL,7,Fa Wolverhampton-based company about
OL,8,Fqueer love and South Asian culture will
OL,9,Fbe shown in cinemas, after being picked
OL,10,Fup by a major distributor.
OL,12,FA Teacher's Gift was co-produced by New
OL,13,FLion Films, based in the city, and was
OL,14,Fshot in London and India, with a
OL,15,Flargely Midlands-based crew.
OL,17,FIt will be released in selected cinemas
OL,18,Flater this year by Peccadillo Pictures,
OL,19,Fa UK-based distributor of art house,
OL,20,Fgay and lesbian, independent and world
OL,21,Fcinema.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
